---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout>

  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Community</h1>
    <p>
      HulettCraft is shaped by the people who play here — builders,
      explorers, and collaborators across many seasons.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="content">

    <h2>How We Connect</h2>
    <p>
      Our Discord server is the heart of the community. It’s where
      announcements are shared, builds are shown off, and ideas take shape.
    </p>

    <a
      href="https://discord.gg/YOUR_INVITE_HERE"
      class="status-link"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener"
    >
      Join the HulettCraft Discord →
    </a>

    <h2 style="margin-top: 3rem;">What to Expect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Long-running survival worlds with seasonal resets</li>
      <li>Collaborative building and shared projects</li>
      <li>Optional quality-of-life tools and client mods</li>
      <li>Respectful, low-drama community culture</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="margin-top: 3rem;">Get Involved</h2>
    <p>
      Whether you’re new or returning, the best way to get involved is to
      jump into Discord, explore the worlds, and start building.
    </p>

    <p class="muted">
      Community screenshots, world archives, and historical content are
      curated to preserve the history of HulettCraft.
    </p>

  </section>

</BaseLayout>
